
Note: this changeset includes prose files (markdown, rst, etc.) alongside code. For findings against prose files, you may quote up to 15 lines of context (instead of the 5-line code limit) so a full paragraph or bulleted section is self-contained in the finding. For prose findings, look for unverified claims, internal contradictions, missing considerations, hand-waved hard parts, and numbers that don't add up — not style, tone, or formatting. The `cwe` field is optional for prose findings; set it to an empty string when not applicable.
